{"unit_id":"elizax__dsh-http-proxy#card-zh","repo":"elizax/dsh-http-proxy","commit":"a7a53f25aebb9a0b9923a5981a12c75068a59dd7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-http-proxy 是面向 DSH 网页端的模型请求代理插件。它包装全局 fetch，按模型 API 主机名将请求交给 HTTP、HTTPS 或 SOCKS 代理，其它主机继续直连。插件可自动识别 DeepSeek、已知模型端点及 llm-pi-ai 中配置的网关，也可手动指定代理和排除主机；设置页提供代理地址与主机列表编辑，保存后后续请求即可使用新配置。适合需要让模型流量经代理、同时保留其它 DSH 请求直连的用户。可通过设置或 DSH_HTTP_PROXY 提供代理 URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:68-114","src/index.ts:133-215","src/proxy.ts:93-102","src/client/index.ts:29-43"]}
{"unit_id":"elizax__dsh-http-proxy#card-en","repo":"elizax/dsh-http-proxy","commit":"a7a53f25aebb9a0b9923a5981a12c75068a59dd7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-http-proxy routes DSH model API requests through HTTP, HTTPS, or SOCKS proxies by hostname, leaving other hosts direct. It detects model endpoints or uses chosen and excluded hosts. A settings card changes routing for later requests. Configure the proxy URL in settings or with DSH_HTTP_PROXY.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:68-114","src/index.ts:133-215","src/proxy.ts:93-102","src/client/index.ts:29-43"]}
