{"unit_id":"elizax__dsh-http-proxy#feature-1","repo":"elizax/dsh-http-proxy","commit":"a7a53f25aebb9a0b9923a5981a12c75068a59dd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-http-proxy 的功能「模型主机代理路由」：将匹配的模型 API 请求交给代理 fetch，其它主机调用原始 fetch。插件挂载后自动路由；主机集合支持自动识别或手动指定，并可配置排除项。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:68-114","src/proxy.ts:93-102"]}
{"unit_id":"elizax__dsh-http-proxy#feature-2","repo":"elizax/dsh-http-proxy","commit":"a7a53f25aebb9a0b9923a5981a12c75068a59dd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-http-proxy 的功能「代理传输」：支持 HTTP、HTTPS、SOCKS4、SOCKS4a、SOCKS5 和 SOCKS5h 代理 URL。插件创建代理 dispatcher，并将匹配主机的请求交给它发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/config.ts:8-16","src/proxy.ts:69-82"]}
{"unit_id":"elizax__dsh-http-proxy#feature-3","repo":"elizax/dsh-http-proxy","commit":"a7a53f25aebb9a0b9923a5981a12c75068a59dd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-http-proxy 的功能「设置页管理代理」：在 DSH 插件设置区域显示代理配置卡片，可编辑代理地址、代理主机和排除主机；提交设置后控制器向设置作用域保存变更。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:29-43","src/client/card.tsx:2-5"]}
